        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer the Dungeon-ified Gensokyo!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a Touhou fan-made roguelike heavily inspired by <i>Dungeon Crawl Stone Soup</i>.<br><br><br>This game is based on a project I created a long time ago, now being improved with localization support, quality-of-life features, additional content, and rebalancing. It will be released as a free game on Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601130/extras/b7e6e17a0d959745e46055efe314b1e8.poster.avif?t=1752765851\" width=786 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601130/extras/b7e6e17a0d959745e46055efe314b1e8.webm?t=1752765851\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601130/extras/b7e6e17a0d959745e46055efe314b1e8.mp4?t=1752765851\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 races, 21 classes, or 10 unique Touhou character starts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 small and large dungeons and 10 runes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 200 types of monsters (including around 80 named Touhou characters)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >21 Touhou character deities to worship</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and the list may keep growing!</p>",
